  "label": "Gendered Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references gendered stereotypes — the idea that certain behaviors, desires, or activities are inherently associated with one gender over another (e.g., masturbation is 'for men'). Understanding these stereotypes is necessary to interpret the meme’s attempt to challenge them, even if the method of presentation reinforces objectification.",
